# Single N Host-DWARF baseline. Copy to baseline.env (ignored), then edit.
# Or export these variables. No path is tied to a particular username.
# The workspace must already contain matching source, artifacts, manifests
# and its board-verified boot_n_candidate.sh with all firmware dependencies.
# STARRYOS_WORKSPACE="/absolute/path/to/prepared-N-workspace"
# K3_OPENOCD_LAUNCHER="/absolute/path/to/existing-verified/start_openocd.sh"
# OPENOCD_HOME="/absolute/path/to/openocd"  # only if supported by that launcher
# Keep the existing launcher's JTAG settings and 3333/4444/6666 port roles.
# Boot/OpenOCD wrappers affect hardware by default. Use --check for offline only.
